    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Partners Buggy are delighted to present this unique property set on a substantial c.0.42 acre site in a peaceful rural location just outside Mountrath.\r\n\r\nFormerly operating as a highly regarded childcare facility, the property now offers an exciting opportunity for purchasers seeking a home with exceptional potential. Planning permission has been granted  for the conversion of the existing building into a charming residence incorporating a spacious open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, shower room, detached shed and a large covered outdoor entertaining space extending to approximately 68.5 sq.m.\r\nThe property enjoys an enviable setting with extensive outdoor areas, generous parking, secure boundaries and attractive countryside views. The existing site infrastructure includes substantial concrete yard space, landscaped play and recreational areas, covered outdoor facilities and ancillary storage buildings, providing enormous flexibility for future residential use.\r\n\r\nThis is an ideal opportunity for those seeking a country retreat, downsizing option, lifestyle property, work-from-home base or a residence with extensive outdoor space and future development potential.\r\n\r\nConveniently located within easy reach of Mountrath, Portlaoise and the M7 motorway network, the property combines the tranquillity of rural living with excellent accessibility."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "c.0.42 acre site\r\nExcellent existing infrastructure\r\nPlanning granted as residential property.\r\nProposed floor area of approximately 47.5 sq.m. with large covered canopy area of approximately 68.5 sq.m.\r\nExtensive gravel parking area\r\nLarge concrete yard and outdoor recreational space\r\nDetached storage shed\r\nSecure site with gated entrance\r\nPeaceful countryside setting"
      },
